*.patch whitespace=-blank-at-eol

# Generated model artifacts, corpora and audit records. Marked `-diff` so git treats them as opaque:
# they are regenerated by the scripts in `vendor/pka-model/` and by `pkaErrorAudit`, never hand-edited,
# and a line-by-line diff of 22,000 rows of measurement output is noise in every review and every
# `git show`. The FILES still version and still travel; only their textual diff is suppressed.
docs/benchmarks/pka-fast-aqueous-error-audit.json -diff
packages/rdkit-adapter/vendor/pka-model/*.json -diff
packages/rdkit-adapter/vendor/pka-model/*.npy -diff
